{"n":62,"name":"Al-Jumu'ah","nameAr":"الجمعة","meaning":"The Congregation, Friday","ayahs":11,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"يُسَبِّحُ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ٱلْمَلِكِ ٱلْقُدُّوسِ ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلْحَكِيمِ","en":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth is exalting Allāh, the Sovereign, the Pure, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"يُسَبِّحُ","tr":"yusabbiḥu","en":"Glorifies","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","tr":"lillahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَلِكِ","tr":"l-maliki","en":"the Sovereign","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلِك"},{"ar":"ٱلْقُدُّوسِ","tr":"l-qudūsi","en":"the Holy","root":"قدس","lem":"قُدُّوس"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","tr":"l-ʿazīzi","en":"the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمِ","tr":"l-ḥakīmi","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِى بَعَثَ فِى ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ رَسُولًا مِّنْهُمْ يَتْلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ وَإِن كَانُوا۟ مِن قَبْلُ لَفِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en":"It is He who has sent among the unlettered [Arabs] a Messenger from themselves reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book [i.e., the Qur’ān] and wisdom [i.e., the sunnah] - although they were before in clear error -","w":[{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","tr":"alladhī","en":"(is) the One Who"},{"ar":"بَعَثَ","tr":"baʿatha","en":"sent","root":"بعث","lem":"بَعَثَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"among"},{"ar":"ٱلْأُمِّيِّـۧنَ","tr":"l-umiyīna","en":"the unlettered","root":"أمم","lem":"أُمِّيّ"},{"ar":"رَسُولًۭا","tr":"rasūlan","en":"a Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"from themselves"},{"ar":"يَتْلُوا۟","tr":"yatlū","en":"reciting","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"to them"},{"ar":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","tr":"āyātihi","en":"His Verses","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ","tr":"wayuzakkīhim","en":"and purifying them","root":"زكو","lem":"زَكَّى"},{"ar":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ","tr":"wayuʿallimuhumu","en":"and teaching them","root":"علم","lem":"عَلَّمَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","tr":"l-kitāba","en":"the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ","tr":"wal-ḥik'mata","en":"and the wisdom","root":"حكم","lem":"حِكْمَة"},{"ar":"وَإِن","tr":"wa-in","en":"although"},{"ar":"كَانُوا۟","tr":"kānū","en":"they were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"قَبْلُ","tr":"qablu","en":"before","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"لَفِى","tr":"lafī","en":"surely in"},{"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","tr":"ḍalālin","en":"an error","root":"ضلل","lem":"ضَلال"},{"ar":"مُّبِينٍۢ","tr":"mubīnin","en":"clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"وَءَاخَرِينَ مِنْهُمْ لَمَّا يَلْحَقُوا۟ بِهِمْ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en":"And [to] others of them who have not yet joined them. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"وَءَاخَرِينَ","tr":"waākharīna","en":"And others","root":"أخر","lem":"آخَر"},{"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"among them"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"who have not yet"},{"ar":"يَلْحَقُوا۟","tr":"yalḥaqū","en":"joined","root":"لحق","lem":"يَلْحَقُ"},{"ar":"بِهِمْ ۚ","tr":"bihim","en":"them"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"and He"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","tr":"l-ʿazīzu","en":"(is) the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","tr":"l-ḥakīmu","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ فَضْلُ ٱللَّهِ يُؤْتِيهِ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو ٱلْفَضْلِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en":"That is the bounty of Allāh, which He gives to whom He wills, and Allāh is the possessor of great bounty.","w":[{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"فَضْلُ","tr":"faḍlu","en":"(is the) Bounty","root":"فضل","lem":"فَضْل"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يُؤْتِيهِ","tr":"yu'tīhi","en":"He gives it","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"(to) whom"},{"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","tr":"yashāu","en":"He wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ذُو","tr":"dhū","en":"(is the) Possessor"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَضْلِ","tr":"l-faḍli","en":"(of) Bounty","root":"فضل","lem":"فَضْل"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","tr":"l-ʿaẓīmi","en":"the Great","root":"عظم","lem":"عَظِيم"}]},{"n":5,"juz":28,"ar":"مَثَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ حُمِّلُوا۟ ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ ثُمَّ لَمْ يَحْمِلُوهَا كَمَثَلِ ٱلْحِمَارِ يَحْمِلُ أَسْفَارًۢا ۚ بِئْسَ مَثَلُ ٱلْقَوْمِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en":"The example of those who were entrusted with the Torah and then did not take it on is like that of a donkey who carries volumes [of books]. Wretched is the example of the people who deny the signs of Allāh. And Allāh does not guide the wrongdoing people.","w":[{"ar":"مَثَلُ","tr":"mathalu","en":"(The) likeness","root":"مثل","lem":"مَثَل"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"(of) those who"},{"ar":"حُمِّلُوا۟","tr":"ḥummilū","en":"were entrusted","root":"حمل","lem":"حُمِّلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","tr":"l-tawrāta","en":"(with) the Taurat"},{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"then"},{"ar":"لَمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَحْمِلُوهَا","tr":"yaḥmilūhā","en":"they bore it","root":"حمل","lem":"حَمَلَ"},{"ar":"كَمَثَلِ","tr":"kamathali","en":"(is) like","root":"مثل","lem":"مَثَل"},{"ar":"ٱلْحِمَارِ","tr":"l-ḥimāri","en":"the donkey","root":"حمر","lem":"حِمار"},{"ar":"يَحْمِلُ","tr":"yaḥmilu","en":"who carries","root":"حمل","lem":"حَمَلَ"},{"ar":"أَسْفَارًۢا ۚ","tr":"asfāran","en":"books","root":"سفر","lem":"أَسْفار"},{"ar":"بِئْسَ","tr":"bi'sa","en":"Wretched is","root":"بأس","lem":"بِئْسَ"},{"ar":"مَثَلُ","tr":"mathalu","en":"(the) example","root":"مثل","lem":"مَثَل"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","tr":"l-qawmi","en":"(of) the people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"who"},{"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","tr":"kadhabū","en":"deny","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","tr":"biāyāti","en":"(the) Signs","root":"أيي","lem":"آيَة"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"(does) not"},{"ar":"يَهْدِى","tr":"yahdī","en":"guide","root":"هدي","lem":"هَدَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","tr":"l-qawma","en":"the people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","tr":"l-ẓālimīna","en":"the wrongdoers","root":"ظلم","lem":"ظالِم"}]},{"n":6,"juz":28,"ar":"قُلْ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ هَادُوٓا۟ إِن زَعَمْتُمْ أَنَّكُمْ أَوْلِيَآءُ لِلَّهِ مِن دُونِ ٱلنَّاسِ فَتَمَنَّوُا۟ ٱلْمَوْتَ إِن كُنتُمْ صَـٰدِقِينَ","en":"Say, \"O you who are Jews, if you claim that you are allies of Allāh, excluding the [other] people, then wish for death, if you should be truthful.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","tr":"yāayyuhā","en":"O","root":"أيي","lem":"أَيّ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"you (who)"},{"ar":"هَادُوٓا۟","tr":"hādū","en":"(are) Jews","root":"هود","lem":"هادُ"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"If"},{"ar":"زَعَمْتُمْ","tr":"zaʿamtum","en":"you claim","root":"زعم","lem":"زَعَمَ"},{"ar":"أَنَّكُمْ","tr":"annakum","en":"that you"},{"ar":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","tr":"awliyāu","en":"(are) allies","root":"ولي","lem":"وَلِيّ"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","tr":"lillahi","en":"of Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"دُونِ","tr":"dūni","en":"excluding","root":"دون","lem":"دُون"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","tr":"l-nāsi","en":"the people","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"فَتَمَنَّوُا۟","tr":"fatamannawū","en":"then wish","root":"مني","lem":"يَتَمَنَّ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","tr":"l-mawta","en":"(for) the death","root":"موت","lem":"مَوْت"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"كُنتُمْ","tr":"kuntum","en":"you are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","tr":"ṣādiqīna","en":"truthful","root":"صدق","lem":"صادِق"}]},{"n":7,"juz":28,"ar":"وَلَا يَتَمَنَّوْنَهُۥٓ أَبَدًۢا بِمَا قَدَّمَتْ أَيْدِيهِمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلِيمٌۢ بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en":"But they will not wish for it, ever, because of what their hands have put forth. And Allāh is Knowing of the wrongdoers.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"But not"},{"ar":"يَتَمَنَّوْنَهُۥٓ","tr":"yatamannawnahu","en":"they will wish for it","root":"مني","lem":"يَتَمَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَبَدًۢا","tr":"abadan","en":"ever","root":"أبد","lem":"أَبَدًا"},{"ar":"بِمَا","tr":"bimā","en":"for what"},{"ar":"قَدَّمَتْ","tr":"qaddamat","en":"(have) sent forth","root":"قدم","lem":"قَدَّمَ"},{"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ ۚ","tr":"aydīhim","en":"their hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلِيمٌۢ","tr":"ʿalīmun","en":"(is) All-Knowing","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِيم"},{"ar":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","tr":"bil-ẓālimīna","en":"of the wrongdoers","root":"ظلم","lem":"ظالِم"}]},{"n":8,"juz":28,"ar":"قُلْ إِنَّ ٱلْمَوْتَ ٱلَّذِى تَفِرُّونَ مِنْهُ فَإِنَّهُۥ مُلَـٰقِيكُمْ ۖ ثُمَّ تُرَدُّونَ إِلَىٰ عَـٰلِمِ ٱلْغَيْبِ وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ فَيُنَبِّئُكُم بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","en":"Say, \"Indeed, the death from which you flee - indeed, it will meet you. Then you will be returned to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you about what you used to do.\"","w":[{"ar":"قُلْ","tr":"qul","en":"Say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"إِنَّ","tr":"inna","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَوْتَ","tr":"l-mawta","en":"the death","root":"موت","lem":"مَوْت"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِى",